# T-1.07 — Prettier is deliberately kept off src/.
#
# Every file under src/ either is upstream's or shadows upstream's. Reconciling a
# shadowed file on an SDK upgrade means diffing it against the pinned 1.365.0
# baseline, and a reformatting pass destroys that diff — it turns a three-line
# change into a whole-file rewrite and makes /docs/OVERRIDES.md unusable. Prettier
# therefore governs the files the theme authored outright: tooling config, scripts
# and workflows. SCSS style inside src/ is stylelint's job, and .stylelintrc.js
# carries no rule that rewrites code.
#
# Prettier also has no Twig parser, so src/views/ was never in reach regardless.

node_modules/
public/
src/
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Upstream's build configuration, for the same reason as src/. Two of these —
# tailwind.config.js and twilight.json — are already register rows the theme
# edits, which makes preserving their upstream shape more important, not less:
# their whole reconciliation story is a readable diff against 1.365.0.
webpack.config.js
postcss.config.js
tailwind.config.js
twilight.json
package.json

# Upstream's repository furniture. Caught on the first run of this config, which
# reformatted dependabot.yml before the change was reverted — the same churn this
# file exists to prevent, arriving from a direction that had not been considered.
.github/dependabot.yml
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
.github/workflows/lint-pr.yaml
.github/CODEOWNERS
.github/pull_request_template.md
.vscode/

# Prose deliverables — reflowing them churns the diff and settles nothing.
docs/
*.md
CHANGELOG.md
